  "description": "Add a refreshing and festive touch to your holiday creations with this Whimsical Christmas Cocktail Clipart Bundle. This cheerful collection features beautifully illustrated Christmas-inspired drinks, including red and green cocktails, creamy holiday beverages, candy cane garnishes, fresh lime slices, holly berries, ice cubes, and elegant glassware. The watercolor-style artwork combines classic Christmas colors with playful cocktail details for a fun and unique seasonal look.\nPerfect for creating Christmas party invitations, holiday menus, cocktail recipe cards, greeting cards, T-shirt designs, sublimation projects, stickers, mugs, tumblers, party decorations, scrapbooking pages, printable artwork, and DIY crafts. These festive drink illustrations are ideal for holiday entertaining, winter celebrations, Christmas parties, and creative seasonal projects.\nIncluded:\n32 PNG Christmas cocktail clipart designs\nFestive red, green, and pink holiday drinks\nCandy cane and lime cocktail illustrations\nChristmas berries, holly, and evergreen accents\nWhimsical watercolor-style drink artwork\nDecorative glasses, ice cubes, and holiday garnishes\nVersatile graphics for digital and printable projects\nFile Format: PNG\nStyle: Whimsical, watercolor, Christmas, festive drink illustrations",
